# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# JetBrains IDEs (RustRover, Rider, IntelliJ). Ignore the whole folder —
# .idea/ is per-developer / per-machine workspace state, not project config.
.idea/
**/.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
*.dll
*.exe
TestResults/

# Local config / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
# Defensive: dotnet user-secrets normally live in ~/.microsoft/usersecrets/<id>/,
# but if anyone ever drops a literal secrets.json into the project tree, ignore it.
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.*.json

# Frontend
node_modules/
dist/
.pnpm-store/
.vite/

# Tauri
tauri/src-tauri/gen/
tauri/src-tauri/target/

# Claude Code runtime files. Keep .claude/skills/ (intentional, committed
# project guidance) — only ignore the per-session lock and any local mem
# stores Claude may put inside the project tree.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/projects/
.claude/cache/

# Local scratch / debug API captures. We frequently dump position/news JSON
# to repo root during smoke tests; those contain real portfolio data and
# must NEVER ride into a public commit.
/positions-*.json
/news-*.json
/u*.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
